      so. We'll tell you immediately if we think an instruction breaks data protection laws, and we don't have to follow
      it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Confidentiality.</strong> Anyone we authorize to process Customer Data is bound by a duty of
      confidentiality.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Security.</strong> We take appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect Customer Data,
      including encrypted connections (HTTPS), access controls so that, in the app, only a company's team members and
      the AI assistants they connect can see its data, according to their roles, private storage for resumes, sign-in
