    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Audits.</strong> We'll make available the information reasonably needed to show that we comply with this
      section. Where data protection laws or the SCCs require more, you or an independent auditor you appoint may audit
      our compliance once a year, with reasonable notice, at your cost, and under a duty of confidentiality.
    </li>
  </ul>

